**Title:** Quiet Bravery by the Ocean's Edge

**Description:** Immerse yourself in a tranquil journey with Ethan, an 11-year-old boy whose heart beats with quiet bravery. Accompanied by his playful otter friend, Ripple, Ethan explores the serene beauty of a coastal shoreline as the sun sets in hues of amber and rose. With each gentle step on the cool sand, the rhythmic murmur of the waves soothes the soul. As Ethan and Ripple discover tide pools teeming with life and climb weathered rocks that meet the sea, they find peace and courage in simply being present. This calming audio experience is designed to lull you into restful sleep, easing anxiety and fostering emotional calm, as the soft symphony of the ocean whispers a lullaby under the starlit sky.

